::Q001::[markdown]θάπτω:{
	~%-100%be a slave (+ dat)#Incorrect. **δουλεύω** is Principal Part 1 of **δουλεύω** “be a slave (+ dat)” (Chapter 6).
	~%-100%conduct the government#Incorrect. **πολῑτεύω** is Principal Part 1 of **πολῑτεύω** “conduct the government” (Chapter 6).
	~%-100%call#Incorrect. **καλέω** is Principal Part 1 of **καλέω** “call” (Chapter 10).
	~%-100%draw#Incorrect. **γράφω** is Principal Part 1 of **γράφω** “draw” (Chapter 3).
	~%-100%hit (with thrown object)#Incorrect. **βάλλω** is Principal Part 1 of **βάλλω** “hit (with thrown object)” (Chapter 11).
	~%-100%suffer#Incorrect. **πάσχω** is Principal Part 1 of **πάσχω** “suffer” (Chapter 11).
	~%-100%do#Incorrect. **πράττω** is Principal Part 1 of **πράττω** “do” (Chapter 5).
	~%100%bury#Correct: **θάπτω** is Principal Part 1 of **θάπτω** “bury” (Chapter 4).
}


::Q002::[markdown]τάττω:{
	~%-100%conduct the government#Incorrect. **πολῑτεύω** is Principal Part 1 of **πολῑτεύω** “conduct the government” (Chapter 6).
	~%-100%teach#Incorrect. **παιδεύω** is Principal Part 1 of **παιδεύω** “teach” (Chapter 2).
	~%-100%call#Incorrect. **καλέω** is Principal Part 1 of **καλέω** “call” (Chapter 10).
	~%-100%rule#Incorrect. **ἀρχή, ἀρχῆς, ἡ** means “rule” (Chapter 4).
	~%100%draw up (in battle)#Correct: **τάττω** is Principal Part 1 of **τάττω** “draw up (in battle)” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%guard#Incorrect. **φυλάττω** is Principal Part 1 of **φυλάττω** “guard” (Chapter 3).
	~%-100%save#Incorrect. **σῴζω** is Principal Part 1 of **σῴζω** “save” (Chapter 7).
}


::Q003::[markdown]μοῖρα, μοίρᾱς, ἡ:{
	~%-100%freedom#Incorrect. **ἐλευθερία, ἐλευθερίας, ἡ** means “freedom” (Chapter 6).
	~%-100%reality#Incorrect. **ἀλήθεια, ἀληθείας, ἡ** means “reality” (Chapter 10).
	~%100%fate#Correct: **μοῖρα, μοίρᾱς, ἡ** → “fate” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%excellence#Incorrect. **ἀρετή, ἀρετῆς, ἡ** means “excellence” (Chapter 3).
	~%-100%muse#Incorrect. **μοῦσα, μούσης, ἡ** means “muse” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%honour#Incorrect. **τιμή, τιμῆς, ἡ** means “honour” (Chapter 7).
	~%-100%wife#Incorrect. **γυνή, γυναικός, ἡ** means “wife” (Chapter 11).
	~%-100%man#Incorrect. **ἄνθρωπος, ἀνθρώπου, ὁ** means “man” (Chapter 1).
}


::Q004::[markdown]Pick the 5th Principal Part of τάττω.:{
	~%-100%σέσωσμαι#Incorrect. **σέσωσμαι** is Principal Part 5 of **σῴζω** “save” (Chapter 7).
	~%100%τέταγμαι#Correct: **τέταγμαι** is the 5th Principal Part of **τάττω** (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%πεφύλαγμαι#Incorrect. **πεφύλαγμαι** is Principal Part 5 of **φυλάττω** “guard” (Chapter 3).
	~%-100%δεδίδαγμαι#Incorrect. **δεδίδαγμαι** is Principal Part 5 of **διδάσκω** “teach” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%γέγραμμαι#Incorrect. **γέγραμμαι** is Principal Part 5 of **γράφω** “write” (Chapter 3).
	~%-100%ἦγμαι#Incorrect. **ἦγμαι** is Principal Part 5 of **ἄγω** “lead” (Chapter 8).
	~%-100%ἠξίωμαι#Incorrect. **ἠξίωμαι** is Principal Part 5 of **ἀξιόω** “think worthy of” (Chapter 10).
	~%-100%βέβλημαι#Incorrect. **βέβλημαι** is Principal Part 5 of **βάλλω** “throw” (Chapter 11).
}


