	~%-100%ἀπό + gen#Incorrect. **ἀπό + gen** means “from” (Chapter 2).
}


::Q071::[markdown]Pick the 3rd Principal Part of τάττω.:{
	~%100%ἔταξα#Correct: **ἔταξα** is the 3rd Principal Part of **τάττω** (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%ἔλυσα#Incorrect. **ἔλυσα** is Principal Part 3 of **λύω** “unbind” (Chapter 2).
	~%-100%ἐδεξάμην#Incorrect. **ἐδεξάμην** is Principal Part 3 of **δέχομαι** “receive” (Chapter 11).
	~%-100%ἐφύλαξα#Incorrect. **ἐφύλαξα** is Principal Part 3 of **φυλάττω** “guard” (Chapter 3).
	~%-100%ἔπαθον#Incorrect. **ἔπαθον** is Principal Part 3 of **πάσχω** “suffer” (Chapter 11).
	~%-100%ἔπαυσα#Incorrect. **ἔπαυσα** is Principal Part 3 of **παύω** “stop” (Chapter 3).
	~%-100%ἐχόρευσα#Incorrect. **ἐχόρευσα** is Principal Part 3 of **χορεύω** “dance” (Chapter 6).
	~%-100%ἔκλεψα#Incorrect. **ἔκλεψα** is Principal Part 3 of **κλέπτω** “steal” (Chapter 7).
}


